    "notice": "One-shot initializer for an AccessManager authority diamond — grants the initial `ADMIN_ROLE` to `admin` and registers the IAccessManager interface (ERC-165). Delegatecalled by {Diamond.initialize} inside the initializing window (so it must NOT open its own pre/postInitializer; the `__AccessManager_init` guard passes because the window is already open). Reverts with {AccessManagerInvalidInitialAdmin} if `admin` is the zero address."
